Package: thortwo
Type: Package
Title: Build and Solve Large Macroeconomic Models
Version: 0.9.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Anissa", "Saumtally", email = "anissa.saumtally@sciencespo.fr",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Charlotte", "Nudelmann", role = "ctb"))
Description: Parses a macroeconomic model written as a text file, decomposes it
    into prologue, heart and epilogue blocks, differentiates it symbolically,
    generates and compiles a model-specific C++ Newton solver, and solves the
    model period by period against a database. Three interchangeable backends
    are provided: a sparse Eigen solver for large models, a dense Eigen solver,
    and a pure R solver. Compiled models are cached between sessions and saved
    models are self-contained.
